            <div xml:id="d140">

                <pb facs="0242" n="142" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg142"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/23663: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Vera Cruz</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Foster</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-04-20T21:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">April 20,
                                1920—9 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 21—5:41
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>I consider conditions in this district are very grave and urgently recommend that
                    an American warship be sent at once. Great danger to American residents if
                    lawless elements get upper hand.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
